<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - BCH 96 attributable seen up 168 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - BCH 96 attributable seen up 168 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish bank BCH. Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billions of pesetas.</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income    283.86     263.75    276.00 - 293.07</p>
<p>    Operating income	 100.76	94.78    94.48  - 108.32</p>
<p>    Net attributable	  33.39	12.47    33.00  - 34.10</p>
<p>    EPS (pesetas)		204	    76	 201 - 208</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Argentaria Bolsa, Beta Capital, Benito y Monjardin, Ahorro Corporacion and Renta 4.</p>
<p>BCH is expected to release its results between January 27 and 31.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
